        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invaders</strong> is a modern <strong>RTS</strong> that combines <strong>tactical</strong> gameplay, stylized visuals, and an <strong>economic</strong> system. As a <strong>commander</strong>, you lead your nation to victory by <strong>researching</strong> technologies, <strong>building</strong> your base and waging war across a <strong>dynamic</strong> world map built from unique hexagonal  tiles. Every move, every battle, and every research decision brings you closer to <strong>total domination</strong>.<br><br><strong>PLAN. DEPLOY. EXPAND.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your <strong>attack</strong>, coordinate multiple armies, and capture neighboring territories in real time.<br>Decide when to split your forces, when to reinforce, and when to <strong>push</strong> forward. Every <strong>move</strong> changes the balance of <strong>power</strong> on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034330/extras/dafd2b69cc1420f7718e5967caa08fb6.poster.avif?t=1768935345\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034330/extras/dafd2b69cc1420f7718e5967caa08fb6.webm?t=1768935345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034330/extras/dafd2b69cc1420f7718e5967caa08fb6.mp4?t=1768935345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DOMINATE THE BATTLEFIELD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Territories change hands rapidly as armies <strong>advance</strong>, <strong>collide</strong>, and <strong>break</strong> through enemy lines. Swift <strong>expansion</strong> can secure critical ground, while poor timing leaves your forces exposed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each captured tile <strong>strengthens</strong> your position and limits your opponent’s options. Control the map, shape the front line, and force the enemy to react to your <strong>momentum</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034330/extras/9f7345bc6713a775f26bcf0066d7861f.poster.avif?t=1768935345\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034330/extras/9f7345bc6713a775f26bcf0066d7861f.webm?t=1768935345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034330/extras/9f7345bc6713a775f26bcf0066d7861f.mp4?t=1768935345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHAPE YOUR MILITARY DOCTRINE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how your <strong>army</strong> evolves through focused <strong>research</strong> paths. Develop heavy <strong>armor</strong> for frontline dominance, advanced <strong>artillery</strong> for long-range pressure, and powerful <strong>warships</strong> to control the seas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>trench warfare</strong> to strengthen defensive positions, or invest in <strong>aircraft</strong> to strike where the enemy is least prepared. Each research direction opens new tactical possibilities and <strong>forces</strong> your opponents to adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034330/extras/9b03e18266679cb8713f6af30efee491.poster.avif?t=1768935345\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034330/extras/9b03e18266679cb8713f6af30efee491.webm?t=1768935345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034330/extras/9b03e18266679cb8713f6af30efee491.mp4?t=1768935345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TURN RESEARCH INTO FIREPOWER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your <strong>discoveries</strong> to work by <strong>producing</strong> newly unlocked units in your <strong>factories</strong>. Freshly researched tanks roll off the production line ready to <strong>reinforce</strong> the front or launch decisive offensives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance <strong>production</strong>, expansion, and military pressure as your <strong>industry</strong> scales. What you choose to build — and when — will <strong>determine</strong> the outcome of the entire conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034330/extras/437848ff1aa8136bf184ea75b6dbbf27.poster.avif?t=1768935345\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034330/extras/437848ff1aa8136bf184ea75b6dbbf27.webm?t=1768935345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034330/extras/437848ff1aa8136bf184ea75b6dbbf27.mp4?t=1768935345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMMAND THE BATTLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your <strong>strategy</strong>, <strong>expand</strong> your territory, and lead your <strong>forces</strong> to victory. Every decision matters, from research priorities to frontline execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Download Invaders and take control of the battlefield.</strong></p>",
